Privacy Policy
Introduction

Our privacy policy will help you understand what information we collect at BMI Calcutaor, how BMI Calcutaor uses it, and what choices you have.

Quiz Aura built the BMI Calcutaor app as a free app. This SERVICE is provided by BMI Calcutaor at no cost and is intended for use as is.

If you choose to use our Service, then you agree to the collection and use of information in relation with this policy. We will not use or share your information with anyone except as described in this Privacy Policy.

The terms used in this Privacy Policy have the same meanings as in our Terms and Conditions, which is accessible on our website, unless otherwise defined in this Privacy Policy.

Information Collection and Use

BMI Calcutaor does not collect or store personal information such as your name, email address, gender, location, or pictures on our servers. All BMI calculations are performed locally on your device.

However, the app uses Google AdMob to display advertisements. AdMob may automatically collect certain information, such as device identifiers, IP address, and app usage data, in order to serve ads and measure their performance. This data is collected and processed by Google, not by us. For details on what AdMob collects and how it is used, please review:

Google's Privacy Policy: https://policies.google.com/privacy
Google's Partner Sites and Apps policy: https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites
Cookies

This Service does not use cookies directly. However, AdMob and other third-party code integrated into the app may use cookies or similar technologies (such as advertising identifiers) to collect information and serve relevant ads. You can manage ad personalization through your device settings (e.g., "Opt out of Ads Personalization" in Android settings).

Location Information

The app may request access to your device's location. This information is not collected or stored on our own servers. It may be used by Google AdMob to serve more relevant, location-based advertisements. You can control location permissions at any time through your device settings.

Device Information

We do not collect device information on our own servers. However, Google AdMob may collect device-related data as described above, for ad serving and fraud prevention purposes.

Service Providers

We use Google AdMob as a third-party service provider to display ads within the app. AdMob may have access to certain device and usage data as described above, solely for the purpose of ad delivery and performance measurement. Google is obligated under its own policies to handle this data responsibly.

Data Deletion

We do not store or retain any personal information on our own servers. Any data used within the app (such as your BMI calculation inputs) is processed locally on your device only and is never transmitted to us.

Some data may be collected by Google AdMob for advertising purposes. To manage, limit, or request deletion of data collected by AdMob, you can:

Adjust ad personalization settings in your device settings, or
Visit Google's My Activity page (https://myactivity.google.com) to manage or delete data Google has collected, or
Review Google's Ads Data policies: https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads

If you have any questions about data handling in this app, contact us at aqeelalansari3@gmail.com.

Security

We value your trust in providing us your information, and we strive to use commercially acceptable means of protecting it. However, remember that no method of transmission over the internet or method of electronic storage is 100% secure and reliable, and we cannot guarantee its absolute security.

Children's Privacy

This Service does not address anyone under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal identifiable information from children under 13. If we discover that a child under 13 has provided us with personal information, we will immediately delete this from our servers. If you are a parent or guardian and you are aware that your child has provided us with personal information, please contact us so that we can take the necessary action.

Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. Thus, you are advised to review this page periodically for any changes. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page. These changes are effective immediately after they are posted on this page.

Contact Us

If you have any questions or suggestions about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us.

Email: aqeelalansari3@gmail.com
